     A** OBJECT IMPORT FILE
     A**
     A****************************************************************
     A* REVISIONS:                                                   *
     A*                                                              *
     A*   05/17/07 C:191 Support: 58389                              *
     A*                  - Add initial date time fields to create    *
     A*                    unique key in logical file                *
     A****************************************************************
     A*
     A                                      REF(SCREFP)
     A          R PI101                     TEXT('DATA FILE - FORMAT A')
     A            I1IDXT    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('INDEX TYPE')
     A***                         Type of Index for Object
     A***                         'D' - DARTS Main Remark (SDCMP)
     A***                         'M' - More Object type - Any obj
     A            I1IMGF    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('IMAGE FILE')
     A***                         CMIMGF value IF this is a Main Remark
     A***                         'W'-Word/Lotus; 'I'-Image; 'F'-Fax
     A***                         ' '-OV/400; 'O'-Other
     A            I1IDIR    R               REFFLD(RED)
     A                                      COLHDG('IMPORT DIRECTORY')
     A            I1ADIR    R               REFFLD(RED)
     A                                      COLHDG('ARCHIVE DIRECTORY')
     A            I1EDIR    R               REFFLD(RED)
     A                                      COLHDG('ERROR DIRECTORY')
     A            I1KPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROGRAM NAME')
     A***                         Program name for Key extraction and/
     A***                         or Import Processing (SCI1xxR, where
     A***                         xx=KeyType)
     A            I1RMCD    R               REFFLD(RMCD)
     A                                      COLHDG('REMARK CODE')
     A            I1DOCT         8A
     A                                      COLHDG('DOC TYPE')
     A            I1DFTT    R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('DOC TEXT')
     A***                         Default Text for Remark or Desc.
     A***                         ' ' - uses DART remark code text
     A***                               (or object name)
     A***                         Value-concatenate w/ File Name
     A***                         *FILE-File name Only
     A            I1PTY          2S 0
     A                                      COLHDG('PRIORITY')
     A            I1AIDX    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('AUTO INDEX')
     A***  Extra flags for later usage
     A            I11A1     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('FLAG NOT USED')
     A            I11A2     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('FLAG NOT USED')
     A            I11A3     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('FLAG NOT USED')
     A            I11A4     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('FLAG NOT USED')
     A            I11A5     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('FLAG NOT USED')
     A***  Extra 10A fileds for later usage
     A            I110A1    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('10A NOT USED')
     A            I110A2    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('10A NOT USED')
     A            I110A3    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('10A NOT USED')
     A            I110A4    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('10A NOT USED')
     A            I110A5    R               REFFLD(DS10)
     A                                      COLHDG('10A NOT USED')
     A            I1STAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A                                      COLHDG('STATUS')
     A            I1USER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('USER')
     A            I1PGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('PROGRAM')
     A            I1TIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('TIME')
     A            I1DT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            I1IUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('RECORD CREATED BY')
     A*** BEG ADD ****** 05/17/07 **********************************************
     A            I1IDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'DATE')
     A            I1ITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'TIME')
     A*** END ADD ****** 05/17/07 **********************************************
     A*
